        <item>
            <title>0.18.18</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 22:34:55 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.18.18</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.18.18</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.18.18</h2>
<ul>
<li>**Swipe shot: the confirmation stops at the furthest point** — it follows your hand only while you move further from the menu; the moment you come back it stays where it was.</li>
<li>**A swipe into a folder shows the menu at once** — the blur and the menu appear together and complete, with no pills growing in.</li>
<li>**Smoother opens** — a slow first frame no longer makes the pills jump outward.</li>
<li>**First-use tips** — a tip is now a title and one short line, with a Show me button that opens its tour; the tips come at your 3rd, 10th, 20th and 30th open, and the alternates tip says to hold the menu&#x27;s own key again.</li>
<li>**No desktop switch** — clicking the menu bar icon, the Shortcut Map, Parts or Report a Bug no longer moves you to another desktop.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
