        <item>
            <title>0.18.16</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 02:37:34 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.18.16</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.18.16</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.18.16</h2>
<ul>
<li>**F keys work like the modifier keys** — a quick swipe while holding your F key fires the pill as you cross it, as with ⌘ Command. A tap of an F key now opens its menu when you let go, and holding it still opens nothing.</li>
<li>**Swipe shot: the confirmation stays under your hand** — it follows the swipe and stops where your hand stops, and letting go of the key no longer cuts it short. A slightly gentler swipe now counts as a swipe shot.</li>
<li>**Held alternates survive a folder** — while you hold the menu&#x27;s key for the second actions, closing a folder brings them back. The folder itself still opens on its main actions, and a folder on the second actions opens with one sound.</li>
<li>**Smoother menus** — the black shapes no longer flicker when the menu opens or a folder closes, the blur behind an open folder costs far less, and the first folder you open after a restart no longer stutters.</li>
<li>**A clearer Setup** — a page of its own for the key shot, a bigger window, animations that show the real swipe speed and start over cleanly, Continue lights up when a step is done, and the keyboard comes back to Setup after the practice menu. Setup now opens without the logo intro.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
